    {
      "text": "Boil the kettle Prick a few holes in sweet potato container. Microwave until hot and steaming, 3 mins In a medium bowl, add couscous and boiling water (3/4 cup for 2P / 1 1/2 cups for 4P). Stir to combine Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork and set aside",
